“The law of the heavens isn’t afraid of cultivators hiding, because once they hide, then their heart no longer contains the meaning of defying…”\N“What the law of the heaven is really afraid of is those who choose not to avoid but to face it… For those creatures, the heavens will do everything it can to erase them… You aren’t the first one, and you won’t be the last…”\N“When others face Ascendant, they either follow the law of the heavens or avoid it, so divine retribution doesn’t arrive. Yet you chose to face it, and that caused the divine retribution to descend…”\N\N[...]\N\NAt the moment the Ascendant Crystal is formed, you might feel like you have become nothing and your soul is wandering the heavens and earth. This feeling is extremely rare and it is called Ascendant Enlightenment.\NNormally, the first thing cultivators on a cultivation planet do is use this moment of comprehension to pull their soul strand back from the Cultivation Planet Crystal. Although the chance is only 50%, they must try !\NWang Lin had already recovered his soul strand, so he obviously didn’t need to do this. At this moment, all of the celestial jades in his bag had already been placed around him. The last bit of celestial spiritual energy had just been squeezed out from the jade before they turned to dust.\N\NThere was a fire storm raging inside Wang Lin as his body underwent earth-shattering changes. His origin soul was like a giant cocoon, his domain was the life inside the cocoon, and the celestial spiritual energy was the raging fire outside the cocoon !\N"Seeking the Dao in the morning only to die by the sunset" is something every Ascendant cultivator knows, and it has a lot to do with this flame. If one can’t get past this trial, then this flame will go from ethereal to real and will burn the origin soul and body to dust in an instant !

